What belongs to a country, not to a product
At the top, the zone, declaring once for everyone inside it which identifier
systems establish that a person is who they say they are, which brokers may
authenticate one, and which subject domains exist. Beneath it three tenants in
that zone: a hospital taking all of it, a laboratory narrowing to two brokers,
and a registry narrowing further still. None of them can widen the set.
